    "text": {
      "features": "Divine Sense (3/long rest): detect celestial, fiend or undead within 60 ft, and consecrated or desecrated places or objects.\n\nLay on Hands (pool of 5 HP, long rest): restore HP by touch. Does not cure poison or disease in this campaign.",
      "traits": "NO DARKVISION — house rule, no race in this campaign has it. Carry torches.\n\nGnome Cunning: advantage on INT, WIS and CHA saving throws against magic.\n\nArtificer's Lore: add twice your proficiency bonus to History checks about magic items, alchemical objects or technological devices.\n\nTinker: 1 hour + tinker’s tools + 10 gp of materials makes a Tiny clockwork device (AC 5, 1 HP) that lasts 24 hours.",
      "backgroundText": "Folk Hero. Skill proficiencies: Animal Handling, Survival. Tool proficiencies: one type of artisan’s tools, vehicles (land).\n\nFeature: Rustic Hospitality — common folk will shelter and hide you.",
      "languages": "Common, Gnomish",
      "tools": "Tinker's tools, Smith's tools, Vehicles (land)"
    }
